ce-reagent-name-brad-healing = Brad's healing mixture
ce-reagent-desc-brad-healing = A cheap mixture that closes wounds. Has side effects in the form of drowsiness.

ce-reagent-name-brad-burn = Brad's burn mixture
ce-reagent-desc-brad-burn = A cheap mixture against burns. Has side effects in the form of weak hands.

ce-reagent-name-brad-blood = Brad's blood mixture
ce-reagent-desc-brad-blood = A cheap mixture that restores blood. Tastes so disgusting that it makes you throw up.

ce-reagent-name-brad-stamina = Brad's invigorating mixture
ce-reagent-desc-brad-stamina = A cheap invigorating mixture with unpleasant side effects.

ce-reagent-name-brad-haste = Brad's haste mixture
ce-reagent-desc-brad-haste = A cheap haste mixture that tires you out very quickly.

ce-reagent-name-brad-mana = Brad's mana restoration mixture
ce-reagent-desc-brad-mana = A cheap mixture that restores mana, with the unpleasant side effect of legs feeling like cotton wool.
